@startuml
actor Scheduler
participant CPU
participant Bus
participant PPU
participant APU
participant Controller

Scheduler -> CPU: execute instruction
CPU -> Bus: read/write memory
Bus -> PPU: PPU register access
Bus -> APU: APU register access
Bus -> Controller: controller read
PPU --> Scheduler: PPU dots / frame progress
APU --> Scheduler: audio samples
CPU --> Scheduler: consumed CPU cycles
Scheduler -> CPU: next clock slice
@enduml
